Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.41,0:17:04.98,Note,0,0,0,0,,（泽维尔天赋青少年学校）
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.29,0:22:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.79,0:22:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 万能的神啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.63,0:22:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,请用你的神力保佑我们 请用你的神力保佑我们
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.26,0:22:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,伟大 万能的神
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.43,0:22:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,请用你的神力保佑我们 请用你的神力保佑我们
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.81,0:22:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是你忠实地信徒
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.98,0:22:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩·沙巴·奴尔
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.94,0:22:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,伟大 万能的神
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.55,0:22:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩·沙巴·奴尔
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.65,0:22:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,请用你的神力保佑我们 请用你的威力保佑我们
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.53,0:22:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,快看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.99,0:22:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,快看
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.79,0:22:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩·沙巴·奴尔
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.12,0:23:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,伟大 万能的神
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.63,0:23:02.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩·沙巴·奴尔
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.54,0:23:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,请用你的神力保佑我们 请用你的威力保佑我们
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.17,0:23:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩·沙巴·奴尔
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.42,0:23:12.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,伟大 万能的神
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.30,0:23:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,请用你的神力保佑我们 请用你的威力保佑我们
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.73,0:24:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我主
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.19,0:24:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事 ？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.53,0:24:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩·沙巴·奴尔
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.96,0:24:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,出事了 不妙 不妙
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.36,0:24:30.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快跑 - 快啊 快跑
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.05,0:34:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.41,0:37:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的 有小偷 抓小偷
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.29,0:37:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住她 抓小偷
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.22,0:42:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,小孩子都出去
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.74,0:42:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 快点
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.21,0:53:25.89,Note,0,0,0,0,,（皮斯马戏团）
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.07,1:04:16.45,Note,0,0,0,0,,（泽维尔天才青少年学校 查尔斯·泽维尔教授）
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.81,1:04:44.48,Title,0,0,0,0,,（正在放映《星球大战：绝地归来》）
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.01,1:19:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,请保持冷静
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.72,1:21:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,收拾起来 我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.56,1:21:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 行动
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.45,1:33:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再重复一遍 X武器已逃逸
Dialogue: 0,1:43:48.93,1:43:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事？大家快出去
Dialogue: 0,2:23:11.21,2:23:13.42,Note,0,0,0,0,,（警告禁制区）
Dialogue: 0,2:23:31.56,2:23:33.57,Note,0,0,0,0,,（X武器）
Dialogue: 0,2:23:42.74,2:23:45.79,Note,0,0,0,0,,（艾塞斯集团）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.97,0:01:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,变种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mutants…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.76,0:01:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,生来即天赋异禀\N{\fnArial\fs30}born with extraordinary abilities…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.64,0:01:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,话虽如此 但他们尚属稚嫩在黑暗中为摸索方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}and yet, still, they are children stumbling in the dark…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.10,0:01:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,而步履蹒跚\N{\fnArial\fs30}searching for guidance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.40,0:01:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,天赋 往往也会是个诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}A gift can often be a curse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.49,0:01:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,拥有一双翅膀 他可能直扑太阳而去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give someone wings, and they may fly too close to the sun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.74,0:01:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他预知未来的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give them the power of prophecy…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.16,0:01:27.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就可能活在对未来的恐惧当中\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they may live in fear of the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.16,0:01:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,若给予一个人所有的天赋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give them the greatest gifts of all…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.08,0:01:33.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,超乎想像的巨大力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}powers beyond imagination…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.42,0:01:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就可能试图统治整个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they may think they're meant to rule the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.77,0:01:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩·沙巴·奴尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}En Sabah Nur.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.69,0:03:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你将永远统治这个世界了 主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you will rule for eternity, my lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.59,0:03:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,沉睡吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.92,0:03:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始移转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let the transference begin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.06,0:05:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,伪神受死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Death to the false god.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.91,0:05:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护好主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Protect him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.28,0:08:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,众所周知 变种人的存在首次被发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}As everyone knows, the existence of mutants was first discovered…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.91,0:08:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,是在1973年越战结束后的巴黎和会期间\N{\fnArial\fs30}during the Paris Peace Accords, after the Vietnam War in 1973.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.46,0:08:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,6天后 我们亲眼目睹一名变种人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six days later, we all watched as one of those mutants…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.34,0:08:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾瑞克·兰谢尔在白宫的草坪上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Erik Lehnsherr, attacked the President…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.68,0:08:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,攻击总统和他的内阁成员\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the Cabinet on the lawn of the White House.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.39,0:08:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,一位年轻的女变种人阻止了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their lives were saved by a young mutant who stopped him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.52,0:08:46.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,兰谢尔逃脱并成为世界头号通缉犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Lehnsherr escaped and became the world's most-wanted fugitive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.73,0:08:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,至于她 从此销声匿迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}And as for her, she disappeared as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.48,0:08:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她已经成为这个新时代的典范\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she has become the symbol of a new age…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.82,0:08:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,而这个世界的面貌自此完全改观\N{\fnArial\fs30}the face of a world that will never be the same again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.40,0:08:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是在跟我女友抛媚眼吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You winking at my girl?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.20,0:08:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你女友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your girl?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.07,0:09:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你看来也太老气了 当她老爸刚好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess you do look old enough to be her father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.73,0:09:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉 同学\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, gentlemen…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.71,0:09:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么事情想要 和班上其他同学分享的么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}is there something you'd like to share with the rest of the class?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.99,0:09:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能去趟洗手间吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I please go to the bathroom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.38,0:09:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的眼睛非常不舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think there's something seriously wrong with my eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.60,0:09:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 史考特 在那之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine, Scott. And afterwards…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.46,0:09:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你顺道 拜访校长跟他解释一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}why don't you stop by the principal's office and explain to him…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.09,0:09:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么上课捣乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you're disrupting class again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.86,0:09:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你认得路\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trust you know the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.09,0:09:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, I do. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.76,0:09:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 别急 别急\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, hang on! Hang on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.69,0:09:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.90,0:09:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你们大多数\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I know most of you were, what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.31,0:09:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时候7岁左右吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Around seven years old at that time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.53,0:09:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,桑莫斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Summers!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.29,0:09:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.75,0:09:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哭吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, are you crying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.00,0:09:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没动手修理你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't even kicked your ass yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.92,0:09:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,桑莫斯。这么喜欢盯着我女友看？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Summers! You want to eyeball my girl?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.51,0:10:46.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.56,0:10:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,10战\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten fights waged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.22,0:10:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,10胜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten fights won.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.85,0:10:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,翼战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Winged Warrior.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.10,0:10:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,猛禽\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Bird of Prey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.73,0:10:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Angel of Death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.06,0:10:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angel!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.90,0:10:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.24,0:11:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,给胖哥来点掌声鼓励\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's hear it for the fat man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.83,0:11:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一位挑战者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our next challenger…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.58,0:11:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,来自…\N{\fnArial\fs30}comes straight…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.25,0:11:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,慕尼黑马戏团\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the Munich Circus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.38,0:11:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,各为女士先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.09,0:11:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,敢于挑战天使…\N{\fnArial\fs30}the only one that could take on an Angel…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.26,0:11:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,必然就是恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the Devil himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.26,0:11:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,隆重介绍…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I give you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.76,0:11:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,惊人的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}the amazing…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.85,0:11:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,神奇的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}the fantastic…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.10,0:11:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,夜行者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nightcrawler!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.12,0:11:52.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,警告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caution{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.04,0:11:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,有高压电\N{\fnArial\fs30}High voltage!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.75,0:11:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉 变种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry mutants!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.97,0:12:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.27,0:12:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,小妞 你走错地方了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you get lost little mouse?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.35,0:12:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,擂台在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fight is over there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.82,0:12:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,还击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fight!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.90,0:12:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不然我俩会被宰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or they'll kill us both!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.24,0:12:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是越来越刺激\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's about to get exciting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.78,0:12:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的意思是这样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, you mean this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.10,0:12:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,夜行者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nightcrawler!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.64,0:12:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 夜行者 - 夜行者\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nightcrawler! - Nightcrawler!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.19,0:13:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.19,0:13:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.06,0:13:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们往那边去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They went that way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.24,0:13:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能变幻\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can transform.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.37,0:13:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.53,0:13:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那位英雄 - 我谁都不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The hero. - I'm nobody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.95,0:13:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not a hero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.12,0:13:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们快离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.94,0:14:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 亨利克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a good night, Henryk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.10,0:14:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 米洛什\N{\fnArial\fs30}You too, Milosz.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.18,0:14:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.64,0:14:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.77,0:15:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good day?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.31,0:15:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.19,0:15:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮娜人呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Nina?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.35,0:15:05.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,在后面 跟她朋友在一块\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out back. With her friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.34,0:15:36.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这首歌你是在哪学的 老爸？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you learn that song, Papa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.22,0:15:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸妈教我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I learned it from my parents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.31,0:15:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,而他们是跟他们的爸妈学的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they learned it from their parents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.35,0:15:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,一代传一代\N{\fnArial\fs30}And them from theirs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.19,0:15:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}And one day…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.02,0:15:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也会唱给你的子女听\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll sing it to your children, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.07,0:15:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们怎么样了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.53,0:15:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的父母\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your parents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.49,0:16:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就离我而去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were taken from me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.87,0:16:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我年纪还小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I was a little boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.88,0:16:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们永远在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they're still here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.09,0:16:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我心里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.85,0:16:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,也和你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.38,0:16:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}With you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.89,0:16:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会离我而去吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is someone going to take you away?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.47,0:16:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.41,0:16:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我们两个太像了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess we're more alike than we thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.58,0:16:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会听我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He won't listen to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.45,0:16:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他总是那样…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's just… He's being…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.08,0:16:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,史考特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scott.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.50,0:16:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me try.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.35,0:17:06.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里闻起来很旧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smells pretty old in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.06,0:17:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,究竟是学校还是博物馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this a school or a museum?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.77,0:17:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一阶 最后一阶\N{\fnArial\fs30}One more. And last one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.12,0:17:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心看路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch where you're going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.54,0:17:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看不到…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.83,0:17:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在跟谁说话？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you talking to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.00,0:17:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.17,0:17:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明明听到你说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just heard you in my head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.34,0:17:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有心电感应 我会读心术\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telepathic. I read minds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.17,0:17:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,那离我远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, stay out of mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.34,0:17:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不想有个怪女孩在我脑子里钻来钻去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need some weird girl creeping around in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.26,0:17:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 史考特 里面没什么看头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, Scott. There's not much to see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.35,0:17:46.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 等等 我没告诉你我的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, wait. I didn't tell you my name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.64,0:17:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 你没说\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you didn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.27,0:17:50.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚历克斯·桑莫斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alex Summers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.31,0:17:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉克·麦考伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hank McCoy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.82,0:17:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 那个大蓝毛怪 跑去哪了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa! What happened to the big, blue, furry you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.69,0:17:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在控制得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I keep him under control now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.15,0:18:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我弟弟 史考特\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my brother, Scott.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.57,0:18:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 史考特 我是汉克·麦考伊 我在这里教书\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Scott. I'm Hank McCoy. I'm one of the teachers here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.62,0:18:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,教授在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the professor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.29,0:18:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,扬弃血腥 忘怀过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}"To break forth bloodily, then the past must be obliterated…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.25,0:18:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切从新开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}"and a new start made.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.54,0:18:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,从新开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Let us now start fresh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.21,0:18:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们完全忘掉过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}"without remembrance…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.30,0:18:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,千万不要彷徨犹豫\N{\fnArial\fs30}"rather than live forward and backward at the same time."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.68,0:18:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,作者写这段话是想表达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, what on earth do we think that the author meant…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.14,0:18:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么样的情绪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}when he wrote all that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.39,0:18:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你们明天要交的报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's going to be your assignment for tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.60,0:18:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好准备 下课\N{\fnArial\fs30}Top marks, everyone. Class dismissed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.11,0:18:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 亚历克斯 很高兴见到你 - 我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Alex. It's good to see you. - You too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.24,0:18:39.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好久不见 你看起来不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look well. It's been a while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.82,0:18:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 你看上去也不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has. Not too bad yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.45,0:18:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.16,0:18:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我弟弟 史考特\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my brother, Scott.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.37,0:18:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 史考特 还迎来天赋学校\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Scott. Welcome to the School for the Gifted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.48,0:18:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 我可不觉得这是种天赋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. It doesn't exactly feel like a gift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.83,0:18:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,一开始都认为不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It never does, at first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.71,0:19:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,了解自己能力的第一步要先知道能力的大小\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first step in understanding one's power is learning the extent of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.09,0:19:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯有如此 我们才能教你如何控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only then can we begin the process of teaching you how to control it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.35,0:19:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你选择留下 我敢保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you do decide to stay, I can promise you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.31,0:19:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦学成 你返回社会\N{\fnArial\fs30}that by the time you're done here, you'll be able to go back into the world…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.48,0:19:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能很稳定快速的融入\N{\fnArial\fs30}and play a stable and productive part in it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.35,0:19:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不把把绷带\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you take your bandages off…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.73,0:19:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,解开给我们看看 到底会发生什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we can have a look at what we're dealing with here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.44,0:19:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚历克斯 请你扶着他面朝安全之处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alex, would you line him up? Face him in the right direction, as it were.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.90,0:19:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,水塘对面有个目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a target just across the water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.53,0:19:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你睁开眼睛试着瞄准发射\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you open your eyes, try and hit that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.08,0:19:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以张开眼睛 史考特\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can open your eyes, Scott.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.12,0:19:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么好怕的 十分的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing to be afraid of. It's quite…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.55,0:19:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,后退 后退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out! Get back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.26,0:19:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,后退 后退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back! Get back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.10,0:19:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那棵树是我五岁时我祖父亲手种的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My grandfather planted that tree when he was five years old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.10,0:19:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我常常在那荡秋千\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to swing from the branches of it, myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.69,0:19:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我最爱的一棵树\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think that was probably my favorite tree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.36,0:20:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,听这口气是要撵我出去吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does that mean I'm expelled?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.36,0:20:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,正好相反\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the contrary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.99,0:20:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你录取了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're enrolled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.66,0:20:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,有卖地毯吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you sell rugs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.37,0:20:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁让你进来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not allowed in this area.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.67,0:21:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这块地毯要卖吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This rug is for sale?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.67,0:21:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了 这…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, this…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.66,0:25:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,地震了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Earthquake!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.38,0:25:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,回去睡觉 亲爱的 回去睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back to bed, please, my darling. Back to bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.05,0:25:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,她又做恶梦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's doing it again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.21,0:25:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都回去睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back to bed, please, everyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.26,0:25:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,别看了 回去睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesse, back to bed, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.55,0:26:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 乖乖 回去睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on now. Spit-spot, back to bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.22,0:26:01.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 快点 回去睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carrie Anne, come on now. Back to bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.44,0:26:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从未看她这样过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never seen it like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.27,0:26:13.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.61,0:26:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让其他孩子来这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let any of the children come this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.13,0:26:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,琴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.65,0:27:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,琴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jean!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.20,0:27:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,琴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jean!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.03,0:27:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我预见世界末日\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw the end of the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.21,0:27:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,到处充斥着死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could feel all this death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.18,0:27:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 就只是梦境罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was just a dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.66,0:27:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,但一切都那么真实\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it felt real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.14,0:27:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.06,0:27:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的意念是我见过最强大的.\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mind is the most powerful I've ever seen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.52,0:27:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 更能说服自身… - 不 这次不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It can convince itself… - No, no… It's not, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.69,0:27:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不仅仅是读心术或心电感应这么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}just the mind-reading or the telekinesis…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.68,0:27:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是另有其物\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's something else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.57,0:27:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,有股暗黑力量在我脑中不断增强\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some dark power inside and it's growing. but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.48,0:27:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,像火焰般\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.41,0:27:47.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为自己没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I was getting better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.87,0:27:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 你没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are. You will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.20,0:27:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后也没事 只要耐心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just have to be patient.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.41,0:27:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 你无法体会闭上眼睛时的那种恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. You don't know what it's like to be afraid to shut your eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.00,0:27:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全被困在自己的意识里\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be trapped inside your own head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.59,0:28:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我觉得我能体会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I think I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.88,0:28:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不久前我也被脑内的声音困扰过\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't so long ago that I was plagued by voices, myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.22,0:28:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,传达着所有的折磨\N{\fnArial\fs30}All their suffering.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.89,0:28:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,和痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}All their pain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.76,0:28:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their secrets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.77,0:28:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我害怕有一天我会伤害别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid one day I'm going to hurt someone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.77,0:28:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,躺下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lie back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.41,0:28:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人都害怕他们不理解的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone fears that which they do not understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.04,0:28:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,您要学习去控制自己的能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will learn to control your powers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.79,0:28:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when you do…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.30,0:28:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就无所畏惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll have nothing to fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.55,0:28:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次她的恶梦不同于以往\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her nightmares were different this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.26,0:28:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许这能解释在实验室发现的异象\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could account for something I saw when I was in my lab earlier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.31,0:28:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,就如同地震释放能量般\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was some kind of tremor. Like an energy surge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.56,0:28:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都有记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}I picked it up on one of my meters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.31,0:28:56.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说那是琴造成的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're saying Jean created it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.97,0:28:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 是别的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I'm saying something else did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.42,0:29:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许她只是感应到了 我不确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe she was reacting to it. I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.76,0:29:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 震波来自地球另一端\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the epicenter was halfway around the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.67,0:29:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 地球另一端？- 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Halfway around the world? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.22,0:29:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我希望你能来看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I was hoping you could take a look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.15,0:29:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就让我们看看能找到什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see what we can find.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.66,0:29:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎您教授\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome, Professor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.92,0:29:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,震源位于开罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, the source came from Cairo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.01,0:29:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我替你输入座标\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll put in the coordinates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.20,0:29:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.54,0:29:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,向上级报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give them a report.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.21,0:30:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？有发现什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.46,0:30:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得汇报这里发生的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something happened here. I can tell them it's real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.38,0:30:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.97,0:30:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.22,0:30:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 莫伊拉 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Moira. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.68,0:30:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫伊拉·玛塔格？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moira MacTaggert?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.68,0:30:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,说详细点？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the details.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.39,0:30:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,她看起还是让人惊艳 跟以前一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}She looks amazing. She's barely aged a day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.64,0:30:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I meant…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.69,0:30:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在那干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is she doing there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.85,0:30:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,中情局和这事有关？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does the CIA want with this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.56,0:30:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,她准备向兰利回报状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's going back to Langley to deliver a report.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.40,0:30:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去那里一趟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to go there…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.57,0:30:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看能否帮到她什么忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}see if she knows something about the tremor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.07,0:30:30.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实是想见莫伊拉一面\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you want to go see Moira.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.82,0:30:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是要去看看那里实际情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to go check her out. Check out… the situation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.58,0:30:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫伊拉·玛塔格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moira MacTaggert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.37,0:30:43.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,去见见回忆里的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like a ghost from the past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.21,0:30:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没错 你救了那个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did a good thing. You saved that man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.92,0:30:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是重点\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not the point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.88,0:30:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我暴露了 你们都会有危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I'm exposed, we're all exposed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.43,0:30:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在必须离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.93,0:30:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,可这是我们的家啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is our home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.56,0:30:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是我们的女儿的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is our daughter's home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.43,0:30:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们活着才有家\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are her home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.02,0:31:03.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们相识的第一个晚上 我就告诉你我是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you who I was, the first night I met you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.44,0:31:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时我相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trusted you then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.27,0:31:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你也要相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to trust me now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.36,0:31:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能再留在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't stay here anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.45,0:31:17.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去叫妮娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get Nina.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.29,0:31:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweetheart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.47,0:31:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不在房间里\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not in her room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.22,0:31:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,后院也没看到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't see her out back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.77,0:31:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nina?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.98,0:31:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nina!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.48,0:31:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮娜 妮娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nina! Nina!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.28,0:31:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nina!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.97,0:32:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nina.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.10,0:32:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you alright?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.97,0:32:21.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.31,0:32:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 先放了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then let her go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.64,0:32:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.64,0:32:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想和你谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just wanted to have a word{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.61,0:32:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都没配戴警徽\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not wearing your badges.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.32,0:32:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No metal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.16,0:32:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天工厂有工人说 他们看到一些事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some guys at the factory said they saw something today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.07,0:32:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些不合常理的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something that didn't add up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.54,0:32:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,请放下武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put your weapons away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.20,0:32:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个好公民 亨利克\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been a good citizen, Henryk…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.87,0:32:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好邻居 好工人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A good neighbor… a good worker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.38,0:32:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你的为人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to believe that's who you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.21,0:32:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.38,0:32:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但镇上没人真正了解你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}But nobody in this town really knows you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.21,0:32:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes you do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.55,0:32:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是亨利克·古斯基\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Henryk Gurzsky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.64,0:33:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,雅各布 我还去你家吃过晚饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jakob, I've had dinner in your home…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.14,0:33:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直在骗我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you were lying the whole time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.43,0:33:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我引狼入室\N{\fnArial\fs30}I brought a killer into my house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.85,0:33:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这人是你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.11,0:33:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是叫万磁王的这个人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you the one they call Magneto?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.30,0:33:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,来抓我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take me in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.97,0:33:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.84,0:33:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,放了我的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just let my daughter go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.36,0:33:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,到你妈妈那边去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go with your mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.20,0:34:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.58,0:34:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,别丢下我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't leave me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.91,0:34:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不会让他们把你带走 - 妮娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not going to let them take you. - Nina.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.75,0:34:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nina.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.63,0:34:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nina.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.80,0:34:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nina.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.02,0:34:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.47,0:34:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,她也是变种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's one of them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.84,0:34:22.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,快让她住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell her to stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.89,0:34:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,她自己控制不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She can't control it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.68,0:34:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,她吓坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's scared of you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.27,0:34:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让他们带你走 我不会让他们带你走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going to let them take you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.44,0:34:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,快让她住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make her stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.40,0:34:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nina! Nina!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.76,0:35:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nina.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.68,0:35:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮娜 妮娜 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nina, Nina, no…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.76,0:35:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要啊 求你 求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, please. Please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.77,0:35:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.48,0:35:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.78,0:35:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样对我的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not my babies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.79,0:35:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要这样对我的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not my babies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.33,0:36:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你们想要的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this what you want from me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.96,0:36:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我命该如此吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this what I am?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.01,0:36:28.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我命该如此吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this what I am?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.46,0:37:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道当小偷的下场吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what we do to thieves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.97,0:37:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,选一只手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pick a hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.38,0:37:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.35,0:37:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟她是一伙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're with her, I suggest you walk away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.60,0:37:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我建议你\N{\fnArial\fs30}While you still can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.69,0:37:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好滚开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walk away{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.19,0:38:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁统治这个世界？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who rules this world?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.61,0:38:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的哪国的话？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What language is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.95,0:38:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,丑八怪 你到底想干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clown-face. What's the deal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.45,0:38:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beat it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.22,0:38:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.81,0:38:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你感受不到 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't feel it, can you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.37,0:38:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 你感受到了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you feel it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.54,0:39:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说 这些年你真没见过她？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you really haven't seen her in all these years?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.55,0:39:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没找过她？甚至没想过？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never looked her up? Not even in Cerebro?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.51,0:39:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚历克斯 你把我当成变态狂吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alex! What do you take me for, some kind of pervert?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.34,0:39:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我偷看过她一次 是两次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I looked her up once. Twice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.35,0:39:15.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,可就一下下 懂吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not in a long time, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.10,0:39:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么做到的？不会舍不得吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you leave things? Any hard feelings?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.81,0:39:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not likely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.98,0:39:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,但人总要喘口气吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody take a break.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.15,0:39:25.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抹去了她对我们之间所有的记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wiped her mind of all memories of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.02,0:39:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,海滩 古巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}The beach, Cuba…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.11,0:39:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}that whole time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.99,0:39:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可是很久以前的事了 亚历克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was so long ago, Alex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.49,0:39:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时人们还不知道有变种人存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before the world knew about mutants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.24,0:39:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我觉得那样对她才是最好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I felt it was the best thing for her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.78,0:39:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.58,0:39:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我来说好坏都不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't really matter what was best for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.42,0:39:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫伊拉·玛塔格 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moira…MacTaggert, hello!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.80,0:39:56.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,请允许我自我介绍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allow me to introduce myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.30,0:39:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是… - 查尔斯·泽维尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm Professor… - Charles Xavier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.26,0:40:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我当然知道你是谁 - 你知道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know exactly who you are. - You do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.64,0:40:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.31,0:40:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,您所有论文我都拜读过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have read all of your papers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.98,0:40:06.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴终于见到你本人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a pleasure to finally meet you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.15,0:40:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫伊拉·玛塔格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moira MacTaggert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.28,0:40:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 亚历克斯·桑莫斯 - 请坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Alex Summers. - Have a seat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.61,0:40:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个 把它放地上就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just throw that on the floor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.65,0:40:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,再次见到你太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's wonderful to see you again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.53,0:40:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说初次见面很荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}To meet you again, for the first time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.83,0:40:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有个儿子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got a son?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.83,0:40:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.64,0:40:23.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有丈夫 还是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does he have a husband?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.77,0:40:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有丈夫吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have a husband?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.63,0:40:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前有过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a husband…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.87,0:40:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是 这工作很难让我按时回家做饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's hard to do this job and make it home in time for dinner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.96,0:40:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,说得太对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good, good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.86,0:40:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,牺牲在所难免 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all make choices, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.18,0:40:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 确实是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, we do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.96,0:40:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 教授 - 是的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Professor. - Yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.31,0:40:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.52,0:40:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是 我们来这希望 你能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was, we were hoping that you would…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.19,0:40:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我们昨天在埃及发生的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}tell us about what happened yesterday in Egypt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.02,0:40:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕这是机密\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid that's classified information.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.74,0:40:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,恕我无礼 不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, I don't mean to be rude, but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.99,0:40:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是怎么进来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}how did you get in here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.11,0:40:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有第5级权限\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have level-five clearance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.03,0:41:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从73年人类发现了变种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever since the world found out about mutants in '73…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.93,0:41:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,就有很多狂热分子视他们为\N{\fnArial\fs30}there have been cults who see them as some kind of…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.70,0:41:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝重现的征兆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Second Coming or sign of God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.21,0:41:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我追踪他们中的一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was tracking one of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.55,0:41:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他自称恩·沙巴·奴尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}They call themselves Ashir En Sabah Nur…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.63,0:41:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这名字自古即有且为世界第一\N{\fnArial\fs30}named after an ancient being they believe to be the world's first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.20,0:41:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界第一是指什么呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world's first what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.65,0:41:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界上第一个变种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world's first mutant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.72,0:41:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为变种人是本世纪的产物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought mutants didn't evolve until this century.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.48,0:41:26.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,理论上来说是 但有些人相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the common theory, yes, but these guys believe…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.98,0:41:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,变种人始祖出现在数万年前\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the first mutant was born tens of thousands of years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.20,0:41:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,更相信他会复活\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they believe he will rise again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.49,0:41:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此寻遍世界上所有古迹遗址\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've been searching ancient sites all around the world for clues.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.57,0:41:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些象形文字\N{\fnArial\fs30}These hieroglyphs…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.60,0:41:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,记载了某种超能力 无人能驾驭的神秘力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}describe a specific set of powers greater than any man could possess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.70,0:41:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们认为他会复活？\N{\fnArial\fs30}They think he lived all that time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.70,0:41:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不全然是 他们相信他有某种能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes and no. They believe he had the ability…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.12,0:41:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以把他的意识移转到另外一个躯体上\N{\fnArial\fs30}to transfer his consciousness from body to body.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.19,0:41:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,每当他濒临死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}And whenever he was close to death…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.85,0:41:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会选择一个新的躯体\N{\fnArial\fs30}he would just take on a new body.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.70,0:41:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中有变种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of these may have been the bodies of mutants…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.52,0:41:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就吸取他们的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}enabling him to take their powers…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.32,0:41:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,累积不同的天赋\N{\fnArial\fs30}amassing various abilities over the years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.80,0:42:00.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 成为一个全能的变种人 - 完全正确\N{\fnArial\fs30}- An all-powerful mutant. - Exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.43,0:42:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论他出现在何处 身边总是会有4个忠仆 门徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}And wherever this being was he always had four principle followers. Disciples.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.39,0:42:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会赋予他们力量作为他的守护者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Protectors he would imbue with powers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.44,0:42:09.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,像圣经里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like the Four Horsemen…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.27,0:42:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,天启四骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the Apocalypse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.11,0:42:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他抄袭圣经\N{\fnArial\fs30}He got that one from the Bible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.32,0:42:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,又或者圣经出自他手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or the Bible got it from him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.28,0:42:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论他统治哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And wherever he ruled…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.07,0:42:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,最终 都以灾难收场\N{\fnArial\fs30}eventually, it would end in disaster. Cataclysm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.12,0:42:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许这就是圣经中所谓的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some kind of…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.79,0:42:26.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,天启\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apocalypse{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.29,0:42:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界末日\N{\fnArial\fs30}The end of the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.75,0:42:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不得不说 阿波罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must say, Apollo…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.63,0:42:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你扮成人类的还真有模有样\N{\fnArial\fs30}the way you ape human behavior is remarkable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.64,0:42:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是阿波罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Apollo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.76,0:42:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这镇上从没有见其他变种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never seen another mutant in this town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.06,0:42:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会说埃及话？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You speak Egyptian?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.68,0:42:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是阿拉伯语？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arabic?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.14,0:42:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,英语呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}English?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.65,0:42:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,伟大的战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great fighter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.74,0:42:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是我的英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's my hero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.07,0:43:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想像她一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to be like her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.49,0:43:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有些吃的 份量不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's some food here. Not much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.66,0:43:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.91,0:43:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爱我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You love me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.16,0:43:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.00,0:43:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还当真啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Illogical.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.83,0:43:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是会轻易爱上人的牧羊女\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not some simple shepherdess you can awe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.17,0:43:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我爱你 那我宁愿爱上一个变种的细菌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, I could no more love you than I could love a new species of bacteria.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.80,0:43:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.18,0:43:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,学习\N{\fnArial\fs30}Learning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.19,0:43:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,街道上满是反对苏联入侵阿富汗\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the streets, there is outrage against the Soviet invasion of Afghanistan…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.11,0:43:43.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,像我们这样愤怒的兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in a brotherhood of our kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.40,0:43:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些示威游行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Several demonstrations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.78,0:43:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,波士顿也有游行 布鲁斯莫顿有故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of them was held in Boston, and Bruce Morton has the story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.95,0:43:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,由于核武器强大威吓 美国不会主动开启战端…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since the advent of nuclear weapons, the United States does not start fights.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.46,0:43:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weapons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.88,0:43:57.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,前所未见如此强大的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never before has man possessed so much power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.80,0:44:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,导致苏联和美国成为超级大国\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soviet Union and United States being superpowers…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.97,0:44:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,超级大国\N{\fnArial\fs30}Superpowers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.68,0:44:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类这么弱还能统治地球\N{\fnArial\fs30}The weak have taken the earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.39,0:44:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,还曾背叛过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}For this, I was betrayed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.81,0:44:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些伪神\N{\fnArial\fs30}False gods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.15,0:44:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,领袖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Idols.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.90,0:44:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,都将不复存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.41,0:44:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已回归\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have returned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.12,0:44:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,新的未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}A new tomorrow…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.37,0:44:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,始于今日\N{\fnArial\fs30}that starts today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.92,0:44:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从哪里来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you come from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.51,0:44:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,在人类尚未迷失方向的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}A time before man lost his way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.85,0:44:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么欢迎来到80年代\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the '80s.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.98,0:44:58.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个世界需要…\N{\fnArial\fs30}This world needs to be…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.44,0:45:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,净化\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cleansed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.99,0:45:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.90,0:45:06.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,拯救\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.32,0:45:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,乱杀无辜拯救不了这个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't save the world just going around killing people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.75,0:45:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有法律来规范人的行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's laws, systems in place for that kind of thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.63,0:45:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}My child…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.00,0:45:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要束缚自己的天赋？\N{\fnArial\fs30}why do you enslave yourself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.34,0:45:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.35,0:45:30.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你变得更强\N{\fnArial\fs30}Making you stronger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.18,0:45:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的女神\N{\fnArial\fs30}My goddess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.40,0:45:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.28,0:45:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.41,0:45:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,时代已经不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}The time is past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.16,0:45:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,再也不需要神了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no room for gods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.88,0:46:02.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不让我和你一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why can't I go with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.54,0:46:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了 我是独行侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you, I work alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.26,0:46:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那等着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.93,0:46:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到你的脸是件好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always good to see your face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.18,0:46:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使那不是你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if it's not yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.39,0:46:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我一份通行证\N{\fnArial\fs30}Papers and passage for one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.98,0:46:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题 那这位男士是要去哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the gentleman going, if I may ask?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.48,0:46:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 不关我事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't know, don't care.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.57,0:46:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是救了他 其他和我无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just save his life. What he does with it is up to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.95,0:46:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,雇佣兵 魔形女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mystique, the mercenary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.15,0:46:32.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,别那么叫我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't call me that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.15,0:46:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你伪装成任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter how much you pretend to be someone else…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.54,0:46:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我卡列班都能认出你来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caliban knows who you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.16,0:46:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于变种人的所有讯息\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there's anything worth knowing about mutants…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.50,0:46:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡利班都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caliban knows it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.50,0:46:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔形女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mystique.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.25,0:46:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,想知道再这么鸡鸡歪歪的下场吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you ask your psychics what'll happen to you if you keep pushing me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.55,0:46:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,会有什下场？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'll happen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.84,0:46:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,灵蝶吃醋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Psylocke gets a little jealous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.81,0:46:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为卡列班喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Caliban likes you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.22,0:46:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡利班喜欢的是钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caliban likes money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.64,0:46:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡列班真的很喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caliban likes you so much…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.69,0:47:01.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以要免费送你一件消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}he wants to give you free information…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.02,0:47:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,是关于你的一位老友\N{\fnArial\fs30}about an old friend…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.15,0:47:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们还是\N{\fnArial\fs30}from back when you had friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.15,0:47:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you remember…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.78,0:47:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾瑞克·兰谢尔吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Erik Lehnsherr?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.11,0:47:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的人看到他在波兰的照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}My girls got a flash of him in Poland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.28,0:47:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他身旁有一堆尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}He left quite a few dead bodies in his wake…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.58,0:47:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中包括他的妻子和女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}including his wife and daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.79,0:47:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,新闻应该很快就发布了 但是卡列班愿意先告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should be in the news soon enough but Caliban gives you a little head start.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.46,0:47:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你能有多快？- 多快？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How fast are you? - How fast?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.59,0:47:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你传输的最大范围\N{\fnArial\fs30}How far can you cover?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.30,0:47:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能看到 或者曾经去过的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}As far as I can see or if I've been there before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.13,0:47:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来 爬行者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with me, Crawler.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.63,0:47:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该叫我夜行者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, it's Nightcrawler.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.26,0:47:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实我本名叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my real name is…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.56,0:47:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,库尔特·华格纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kurt Wagner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.52,0:47:46.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,镜片是由红色的石英做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The lenses are made of some ruby quartz I had lying around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.27,0:47:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该能折射你发射的光束\N{\fnArial\fs30}They should be able to refract your optic beams…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.19,0:47:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,并保存在向量场内\N{\fnArial\fs30}and keep them contained within their own vector fields.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.40,0:47:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴上试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try them on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.25,0:48:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Go ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.96,0:48:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 抱歉 不是这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, sorry, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.13,0:48:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.18,0:48:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在？- 是啊 做得不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now? - Yeah, you're good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.26,0:48:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.35,0:48:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.81,0:48:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.52,0:48:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.15,0:48:27.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,教授 谢谢 你真是个天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}Professor, thank you. You're a genius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.19,0:48:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.61,0:48:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还不是教授 我希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not a professor. I wish…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.82,0:48:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.66,0:48:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你们两个已经见过了 她是琴·葛蕾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe you two met. That's Jean Grey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.49,0:48:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚到这里时碰到过她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bumped into her when you arrived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.91,0:48:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等一下 这是她？- 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait, that's her? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.25,0:48:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.13,0:48:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.67,0:48:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 这里没有我想像的那么糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. It's not as bad as I thought here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.18,0:48:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.30,0:48:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 应该有人警告这个新来的家伙 - 对 有人应该告诉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Someone should warn the new kid. - Yeah. Someone should tell him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.80,0:49:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们还是挺怕我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're still scared of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.51,0:49:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我现在有神奇的眼镜啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I have special glasses now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.52,0:49:03.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不是怕你\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not scared of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.98,0:49:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们害怕的是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're scared of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.27,0:49:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是唯一不能完全控制能力的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not the only one who can't fully control your powers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.61,0:49:11.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, so…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.78,0:49:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚的地震\N{\fnArial\fs30}last night, when the house shook…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.03,0:49:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你搞的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}that was you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.20,0:49:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉吓到你 所以你不是这所学校最大的怪人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry to break it to you, but you're not the biggest freak in the school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.78,0:49:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 叫你第一名\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's a first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.51,0:49:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞雯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.31,0:49:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.64,0:49:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… You're…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.56,0:49:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是蓝色？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not blue?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.89,0:49:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like you and I have that in common, now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.98,0:49:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 我的意思是 你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, I meant… you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.98,0:49:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.82,0:49:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,没想到能在这见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never thought I'd see you here again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.07,0:50:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, me neither.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.83,0:50:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是蓝人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm blue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.66,0:50:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫库尔特\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Kurt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.00,0:50:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.58,0:50:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,库尔特·华格纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kurt Wagner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.58,0:50:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.88,0:50:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们打烊了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're closed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.89,0:50:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就说怎么冷飕飕的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew I felt a chill in the air.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.77,0:50:25.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么进来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you get in here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.10,0:50:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这么进来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We let ourselves in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.27,0:50:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来找变种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are looking for mutants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.94,0:50:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道怎么能找到他们 所以我们来找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since you know where to find them, we came here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.19,0:50:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡列班不认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caliban doesn't know you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.78,0:50:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在找最强的变种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're looking for the strongest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.95,0:50:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.24,0:50:44.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事 灵蝶\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine, Psylocke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.24,0:50:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们带了多少钱？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much money do you have?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.45,0:50:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}None.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.62,0:50:51.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡列班说过…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like Caliban said…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.79,0:50:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们打烊了 懂吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}we are closed. Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.09,0:50:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你的帮忙 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need your help, my child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.42,0:51:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看上去不像卡利班他爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't look like Caliban's father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.80,0:51:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了没毛这点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe a little bit up here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.56,0:51:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都是我的子孙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are all my children…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.60,0:51:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都迷失了方向 因为你们跟错了领路者\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're lost, because you follow blind leaders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.78,0:51:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些愚蠢的伪神\N{\fnArial\fs30}These false gods…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.49,0:51:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,和脆弱的体制\N{\fnArial\fs30}systems of the weak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.45,0:51:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不允许他们继续毁灭我的世界…\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've ruined my world…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.16,0:51:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.84,0:51:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.51,0:51:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.64,0:51:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,感受到你真正的实力\N{\fnArial\fs30}to feel the full reach of your power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.48,0:52:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前你只发挥了很小一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've only had a taste of your true strength.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.78,0:52:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不像那些试图控制你的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unlike others who seek to control you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.03,0:52:07.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要完全释放你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to set you free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.29,0:52:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我知道你要找的人是谁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know the kind of mutants you're looking for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.72,0:52:24.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能帮你找到他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know where to find them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.80,0:52:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我第一次来美国\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my first time in America.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.47,0:52:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很想见识一下你们的文化\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm very excited to see your culture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.52,0:52:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这你可看不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you're not gonna see it here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.35,0:52:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里只有英国人留下的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only thing American about this place is that it used to be British.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.69,0:52:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是史考特\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Scott.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.33,0:52:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也是新来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's new here, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.40,0:52:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我越狱计划已备妥了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm already up for a prison break.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.24,0:52:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说蓝精灵要不要一起出去兜风？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we say, we take this blue guy on a little field trip?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.82,0:52:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这附近有座大卖场\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure there's a mall around here, somewhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.24,0:52:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,大卖场是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's a mall?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.58,0:52:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,大卖场是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's a mall?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.75,0:52:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,基于民族自尊心 更应该带他见识一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, now this is a matter of national pride. Civic duty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.75,0:52:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,史考特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scott.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.18,0:52:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？你被关在这里太久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? You've been cooped up here for a long time…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.25,0:53:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正教授不在家\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the Professor's not even home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.22,0:53:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我挺想去大卖场看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to go to the mall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.93,0:53:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,尝试一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.26,0:53:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.52,0:53:10.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,教授的车放哪了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where does he keep his cars?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.41,0:53:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,听不懂吗 我说了「滚开」？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or should I say "piss off"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.79,0:53:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the guy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.21,0:53:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他曾经是\N{\fnArial\fs30}He used to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.79,0:53:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道他的翅膀变得…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know his wings were…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.88,0:53:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.42,0:53:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的能力不比从前了\N{\fnArial\fs30}His fighting days are done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.55,0:53:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, they're not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.93,0:53:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们到底想干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.40,0:53:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想送你一样东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to give you something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.31,0:54:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给不了任何我想要的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing you can give me that I want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.40,0:54:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, there is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.29,0:54:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 乖宝宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, my son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.10,0:54:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.03,0:54:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来 我的天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rise, my angel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.87,0:54:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.07,0:55:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,超音速 防爆 具隐形功能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hypersonic, blast resistant, stealth technology.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.07,0:55:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,太惊人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's impressive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.87,0:55:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么把它从这里弄出去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you ever gonna get it out of here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.58,0:55:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不用担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.75,0:55:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,篮球场上方是可移动式屋顶\N{\fnArial\fs30}I built a retractable roof into the basketball court.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.21,0:55:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉克 你在这里造了一架战斗机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hank, you're building a warplane down here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.21,0:55:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,从华盛顿发生事故之后 我认为我们应该重新\N{\fnArial\fs30}After what happened in Washington, I thought we were going to come back…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.96,0:55:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,启动X战警计划 就像我们之前设想的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and start the X-Men, like we all used to talk about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.22,0:55:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.63,0:55:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,查尔斯要的是学生而不是战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charles wants students, not soldiers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.10,0:55:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他相信人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he thinks the best of people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.81,0:55:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,且存有幻想\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.27,0:55:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.77,0:56:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为我们应该抱持希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I think we should hope for the best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.89,0:56:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,同时要做最坏的打算\N{\fnArial\fs30}And prepare for the worst.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.11,0:56:07.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个世界需要X战警\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think the world needs the X-Men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.98,0:56:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然现在你回来了 或许你能帮我说服他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And maybe now that you're back, you could help me convince him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.66,0:56:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让我们… - 汉克 我回来是为了艾瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We could start it together. - Hank, I'm here about Erik.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.55,0:56:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 艾瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Erik.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.22,0:56:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.58,0:56:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当然 - 我想他可能遇到了麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Of course. - I think he might be in some kind of trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.67,0:56:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,大麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.63,0:56:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他哪次不是这样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't he always?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.54,0:57:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们昨天有人把看到自以为是的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of you spoke to the police…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.87,0:57:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,向警察告密\N{\fnArial\fs30}about what you believe you witnessed here yesterday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.13,0:57:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们想知道我的能力吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to know my powers…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.55,0:57:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,想知道我是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}know who I am…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.80,0:57:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我能做些什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}see what I can do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.89,0:57:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会让你们知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll show you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.06,0:57:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,想一想你们生命中最爱的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think of the person you love most in your life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.40,0:57:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.49,0:57:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.87,0:57:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,和女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.91,0:57:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们很快就会尝到失去至爱的滋味\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that person will know what it is to lose someone they love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.29,0:57:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,在悲痛中度过一生\N{\fnArial\fs30}And live with that pain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.09,0:57:55.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.17,0:57:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨利克 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henryk, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.93,0:57:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.51,0:58:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的名字不叫亨利克\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name isn't Henryk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.31,0:58:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫万磁王\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Magneto.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.42,0:58:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们他妈的谁啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the fuck are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.71,0:58:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.26,0:58:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever you are…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.38,0:58:40.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,别想试着阻止我杀了这些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't try to stop me from killing these men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.03,0:59:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这里不是为了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not here for them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.78,0:59:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是为你而来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.59,0:59:24.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,来看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come and see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.55,1:00:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的天赋由此而生\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where your power was born.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.72,1:00:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,同时也是你的同胞被屠杀的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is where your people were slaughtered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.74,1:00:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不应该带我来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't have brought me here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.28,1:00:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.74,1:00:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你害怕到这里来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you afraid to be here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.50,1:00:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你摆脱不了 艾瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't escape it, Erik.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.42,1:00:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.21,1:00:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶和华 神 太阳神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elohim, Shen, Ra.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.59,1:00:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在无数次轮回中有太多的称呼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been called many names over many lifetimes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.64,1:00:50.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在死亡中诞生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am born of death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.52,1:00:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我将点燃唤醒人类的火焰\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was there to spark and fan the flame of man's awakening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.27,1:00:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,倾覆文明的车轮\N{\fnArial\fs30}To spin the wheel of civilization.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.86,1:00:59.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,播种新的种子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when the forest would grow rank…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.61,1:01:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,让世界走向正轨…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and needed clearing for new growth…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.82,1:01:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正履行使命点燃这把火\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was there to set it ablaze.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.57,1:01:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where were you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.24,1:01:11.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我的父母在这被屠杀的时候？\N{\fnArial\fs30}when my father and mother were slaughtered in this place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.87,1:01:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,沉睡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Asleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.45,1:01:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,被困在黑暗中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trapped in darkness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.17,1:01:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时我无法到此 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was not there for you, my son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.29,1:01:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,可现在有我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I am here now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.71,1:01:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我比你更了解你的能力有多强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know your own strength, but I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.43,1:01:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,用心灵感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reach down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.68,1:01:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,蕴藏在地下的金属\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feel the metal in the ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.27,1:01:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,感受地心深处的黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reach as deep as you can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.27,1:01:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会发现你拥有足以颠覆世界的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll find you have the power to move the very Earth itself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.60,1:02:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类创建的一切都会崩塌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything they've built will fall!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.94,1:02:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我们将在这灰烬之上\N{\fnArial\fs30}And from the ashes of their world…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.95,1:02:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,缔造一个更好的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll build a better one!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.98,1:03:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚波兰中部的一个小镇 发现兰谢尔踪迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lehnsherr was identified yesterday, in this small town in central Poland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.40,1:03:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,各国领导人呼吁国人保持冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leaders from all communities are urging their citizens to remain calm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.48,1:03:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,当地在警察和军队 正在严密搜索在逃犯万磁王\N{\fnArial\fs30}As police and armed forces are mobilizing to find Lehnsherr…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.90,1:03:11.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,以防止其发起另一波攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}…before he can strike again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.41,1:03:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果任何人有兰谢尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}If anyone has information about Lehnsherr…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.66,1:03:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,更准确说应是万磁王的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}or as he is also known, Magneto…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.79,1:03:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,请立即联系您当地警方\N{\fnArial\fs30}contact your local authorities immediately…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.46,1:03:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,并请保持警惕\N{\fnArial\fs30}and proceed with caution…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.54,1:03:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 因为他是极度危险的人物 - 皮特\N{\fnArial\fs30}- as he is considered extremely… - Peter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.63,1:03:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.13,1:03:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你在干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just checking on you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.47,1:03:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好 玩小精灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm good. Playing Pac-Man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.10,1:03:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的不过来看这个？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure you weren't watching this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.56,1:03:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们都在庆祝与变种人和平共处10周年之际\N{\fnArial\fs30}This news comes at a time when the world is celebrating 10 years of peace…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.60,1:03:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,一则惊人消息传来\N{\fnArial\fs30}between mutants and mankind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.86,1:03:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是想去找他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going after him, aren't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.32,1:03:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是让我多出去走走吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanted me to get out of the house more, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.24,1:03:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拦不住你 也没人能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't stop you. Nobody can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.11,1:03:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,但相信我 这不会有好结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}But trust me, this won't end well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.28,1:03:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要跟他扯上关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing does with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.71,1:04:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不怕他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not afraid of him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.46,1:04:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.32,1:04:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在文章里读到过这个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've read so much about this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.82,1:04:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际到了这里 似乎有些熟悉的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But being here, it actually seems kind of…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.78,1:04:39.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}familiar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.54,1:04:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,真诡异\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strange.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.70,1:04:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.00,1:04:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,下车吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.04,1:04:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是「帝国大反击」最经典\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just saying, Empire is still the best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.00,1:04:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不仅剧情复杂 人物描写也很丰满\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the most complex, the most sophisticated…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.71,1:04:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,结局又不太悲惨\N{\fnArial\fs30}wasn't afraid to have a dark ending.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.21,1:04:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过拜托 如果没有第一部\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but come on. If it wasn't for the first one…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.88,1:04:54.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,就不会有后面的续集\N{\fnArial\fs30}you wouldn't have any of the rest of the movies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.55,1:04:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少我们一致同意第三部最烂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, at least we can all agree, the third one's always the worst.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.85,1:05:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉克 你在吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hank. Are you in here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.64,1:05:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想让你见见…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like you to meet…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.27,1:05:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫伊拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moira.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.56,1:05:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞雯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.27,1:05:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我们认识吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, have we met?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.86,1:05:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉克 亚历克斯 玛塔格探员 能让我们单独谈两句吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hank, Alex, Agent MacTaggert, would you give us just one moment, please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.41,1:05:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.29,1:05:23.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,查尔斯 她为什么没认出我？她见过我这种样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charles, why didn't she recognize me? She knew me in this form.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.91,1:05:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,当年在古巴海滩 你离开之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, after you left me on the beach in Cuba…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.79,1:05:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我消除了她的那段记忆 请坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took her memories of that time. Have a seat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.34,1:05:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸运的女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucky girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.01,1:05:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你 瑞雯\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good to see you, Raven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.01,1:05:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 欢迎回家 - 这不是我的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Welcome home. - This isn't my home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.54,1:05:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少曾经是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.36,1:05:43.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这是你家 我只是住过而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it was your home. I just lived here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.48,1:05:46.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我几乎都认不出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I barely even recognize it now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.44,1:05:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道到我对这地方的憧憬\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I have plans for this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.48,1:05:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是想把它变成真正的校园\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean to turn it into a real campus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.36,1:05:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,一所大学\N{\fnArial\fs30}A university.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.61,1:05:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不仅是为变种人 普通人也能加入\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not just for mutants, either, for humans too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.36,1:05:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起生活 一起工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Living and working…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.74,1:06:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起成长\N{\fnArial\fs30}growing together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.16,1:06:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 我以前也很相信这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I really believed that once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.04,1:06:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,华盛顿事件后我以为我们能改变他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really believed we could change them after DC.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.37,1:06:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.54,1:06:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 查尔斯 他们仍然害怕及憎恶我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Charles. They still hate and fear us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.67,1:06:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是表面很难看出来 他们更小心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just harder to see because they're more polite about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.09,1:06:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我受够了这种谎言\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got sick of living that lie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.50,1:06:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你才不想让别看到你原本的样貌\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why you're not in your natural blue form.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.72,1:06:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想用一个不存在的世界的样貌出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna be the face of a world that doesn't exist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.51,1:06:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况越来越好 世界也变得更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things are better. The world is better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.72,1:06:24.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许在威彻斯特是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe in Westchester.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.18,1:06:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是在外面 变种人仍在逃亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out there, mutants are still running…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.77,1:06:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,躲避 生活在恐惧中\N{\fnArial\fs30}hiding, living in fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.52,1:06:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使没有战争 并不代表世界是和平的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just because there's not a war, doesn't mean there's peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.02,1:06:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,真要教孩子有用的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to teach your kids something, teach them that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.86,1:06:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,就该教他们如何战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Teach them to fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.57,1:06:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则他们一辈子都只能躲在这理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Otherwise they might as well live in this house for the rest of their lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.70,1:06:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说话的样子 跟当年的艾瑞克一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still sound just like him.You sound just like Erik.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.95,1:06:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这次回来 也是因为他\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I'm here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.25,1:06:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他复出了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's resurfaced.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.21,1:06:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的妻子和女儿都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had a wife and a child. They were killed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.34,1:06:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,为报仇他杀了几个警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Along with a handful of policemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.97,1:07:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,全世界在找他\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole world will be looking for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.76,1:07:05.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,在被找到之前 请你先帮我找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you can help me find him before they do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.94,1:07:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫伊拉 请你务必保守这个秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moira, I'm going to have to ask you to keep this a secret.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.98,1:07:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不知道这是个什么… 东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even know what this is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.20,1:07:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是超脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Cerebro.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.82,1:07:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,进化版\N{\fnArial\fs30}The new model.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.99,1:07:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 采用颜色\N{\fnArial\fs30}I based the color on…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.95,1:07:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,无所谓\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.89,1:07:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are those?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.60,1:07:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些全是世界上的人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are all the humans of the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.98,1:07:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,而这些…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And these…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.36,1:07:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是变种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}are all the mutants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.65,1:07:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我连接感应到他们每个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm connected to all of their minds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.19,1:08:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,中情局做梦都会想有这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}The CIA would kill for this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.28,1:08:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know they would.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.53,1:08:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪里 艾瑞克？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you, Erik?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.53,1:08:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,查尔斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charles?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.15,1:08:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 老朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, old friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.95,1:08:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I am so sorry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.37,1:08:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感受到你的痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel your pain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.75,1:08:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你的遭遇\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your loss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.71,1:08:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为 因为你能感应到我的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think because you can see into my head…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.09,1:09:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就懂那种感受吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know how it feels?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.92,1:09:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找错了地方了 查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're looking in the wrong place, Charles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.51,1:09:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情不该是这样的 这是个可怕的错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to them, it was terribly wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.97,1:09:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,回来吧 艾瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}But come back to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.39,1:09:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.77,1:09:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.44,1:09:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想你的妻子和女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think of your wife, think of your daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.94,1:09:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想要的是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would they have wanted?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.73,1:09:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们只是想活着而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}They would have wanted to live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.28,1:09:23.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我试过你的方法 查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried your way, Charles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.49,1:09:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我试着像他们一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to be like them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.95,1:09:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,简单地活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Live like them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.08,1:09:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,但结局总是一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it always ends the same way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.33,1:09:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们夺走了我的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}They took everything away from me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.71,1:09:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.51,1:09:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,轮到我们去夺取他们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll take everything from them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.15,1:09:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hank…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.69,1:10:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's not alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.95,1:10:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,太不可思议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Extraordinary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.04,1:10:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.33,1:10:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要的答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}The answer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.63,1:10:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,查尔斯 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Charles, wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.31,1:10:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.19,1:10:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你让我进入你的意识\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for letting me in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.78,1:10:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,查尔斯 快出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charles, get out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.91,1:10:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,查尔斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charles, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.95,1:10:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从未感受过如此强大的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never felt power like this before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.29,1:10:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charles…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.16,1:10:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,查尔斯 快出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charles, get out of there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.58,1:10:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是怎么了 发生什么事了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on? What's happening?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.33,1:10:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.17,1:11:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人侵入了超脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone's taken over Cerebro.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.50,1:11:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 而且控制了它 - 为了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They've taken control of it. - To do what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.25,1:11:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,连接查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}To connect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.81,1:11:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,一如既往\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.02,1:11:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼前这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now, all this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.36,1:11:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不再需要石块\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more stones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.61,1:11:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不再需要长矛\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more spears.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.96,1:11:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不再需要抛石器\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more slings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.84,1:11:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不再需要长剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more swords.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.05,1:11:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不再需要武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more weapons!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.51,1:11:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不再需要任何制度\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more systems!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.39,1:11:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,全部不再需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.56,1:12:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,更不需要超级大国\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more superpowers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.81,1:12:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charles!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.15,1:12:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hank!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.09,1:12:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这到底是怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.42,1:12:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁动了钥匙？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's turning the keys?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.76,1:12:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们手里啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}The men are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.39,1:12:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁下令发射的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who green-lit the launch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.18,1:12:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉克 想想办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hank, do something!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.77,1:12:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,它关不掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}It won't shut down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.90,1:12:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们与三叉戟和北极星潜艇失去了联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've lost contact with all Trident and Polaris subs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.78,1:12:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,空军也回报了同样的状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Air Force is reporting the same thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.90,1:12:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们太依赖 武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}So much faith in their tools…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.36,1:12:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,和装备\N{\fnArial\fs30}and their machines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.20,1:12:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,俄罗斯 中国\N{\fnArial\fs30}Russia, China…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.70,1:13:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,英国 以色列 印度\N{\fnArial\fs30}England, Israel, India.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.58,1:13:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,都发射了核弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody's got nukes in the air.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.62,1:13:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标为何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the target?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.79,1:13:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,要打哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are they going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.04,1:13:08.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,向上 直线上升\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up, straight up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.09,1:13:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚历克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alex…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.96,1:13:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 毁了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Destroy it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.42,1:13:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,摧毁这一切 摧毁超脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Destroy everything. Destroy Cerebro!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.26,1:13:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,彻底摧毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wreak havoc!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.98,1:13:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以从通天塔发射弓弩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can fire your arrows from the Tower of Babel…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.12,1:13:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你永远无法挑战上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you can never strike God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.18,1:14:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,查尔斯 查尔斯 你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charles, Charles, are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.12,1:14:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Erik.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.83,1:14:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charles!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.33,1:14:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚历克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alex!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.12,1:14:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.21,1:14:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, asshole!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.13,1:14:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切即将揭晓 孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}All will be revealed, my child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.46,1:14:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.71,1:14:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.72,1:17:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.23,1:17:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.90,1:17:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在找教授 我以为他住在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was looking for the Professor. I thought he lived here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.03,1:17:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把他带走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They took him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.41,1:17:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是她 是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's the one. It's her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.12,1:17:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.45,1:17:54.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会帮助我们吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is she gonna help us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.09,1:18:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们尊重你\N{\fnArial\fs30}They look up to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.68,1:18:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.51,1:18:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}they need you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.44,1:18:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是他们需要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not what they need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.27,1:18:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太棒了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's awesome!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.78,1:18:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了什么？亚历克斯在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened? Where's Alex?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.28,1:18:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我哥哥在哪了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's my brother?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.20,1:18:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很确定我救了所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty sure I got everybody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.42,1:18:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚历克斯在最接近爆炸的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alex was closest to the blast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.81,1:18:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚历克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alex…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.83,1:19:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一步到位\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're one click out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.17,1:19:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 孩子们 就这样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, boys. This is it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.34,1:19:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,医疗救援已在途中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Medical assistance is on the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.84,1:19:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,请保持冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please remain calm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.26,1:19:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,医疗救援已在途中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Medical assistance is on the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.10,1:19:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,请保持冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please remain calm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.52,1:19:44.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,医疗救援已在途中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Medical assistance is on the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.77,1:19:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,请保持冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please remain calm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.44,1:19:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,医疗救援已在途中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Medical assistance is on the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.16,1:19:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我是莫伊拉·玛塔格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Moira MacTaggert!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.28,1:19:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,CIA 谢天谢地你们来啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}CIA! Thank God you're here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.00,1:20:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.67,1:20:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.55,1:20:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.72,1:20:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.39,1:20:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.56,1:20:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 和她 - 是的先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And her. - Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.86,1:20:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,别管这些孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave the kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.08,1:20:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们干什么？- 安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do we do? - Keep quiet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.25,1:20:45.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,X射线7号 我在周围做最后一次检查\N{\fnArial\fs30}X-Ray 7, I'm doing a final sweep of the ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.01,1:20:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你 安全吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get them on the bird!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.18,1:20:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.19,1:21:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 琴 我们一定要帮助他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Jean. We gotta help them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.27,1:21:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 库尔特 你能带我们进入那个东西里吗？- 你想进入那里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kurt, can you get us in that thing? - You want to get in there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.07,1:21:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果那些士兵看见我们怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if the soldiers see us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.36,1:21:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要担心 他们不会看到我们 相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, they won't see us. Trust me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.40,1:21:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.46,1:21:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,库尔特 带我们都离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kurt, get us all out of here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.13,1:21:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.64,1:21:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们关了门以后 产生了某种电场\N{\fnArial\fs30}When they closed the doors, there's some kind of electrical field.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.31,1:21:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,它就像柏林围墙一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like Berlin all over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.77,1:21:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,琴 控制飞行员 不要让他们起飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jean, get in the pilots' heads. Don't let them take off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.43,1:21:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做不到 我无法操控飞行员 我不能操控任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't. I can't reach the pilots. I can't reach anyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.15,1:21:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也收到来自欧洲和亚洲的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're also getting reports out of Europe and Asia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.66,1:21:58.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不仅是美国有此情事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was not just a U.S. phenomenon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.99,1:22:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,似乎世界各地都使用核武\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems the entire world has been disarmed of nuclear weapons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.33,1:22:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,五角大厦已经证实 大多数核弹来自俄罗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Pentagon has confirmed multiple launches…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.83,1:22:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有英国 以色列和中国\N{\fnArial\fs30}from Russia, as well as the UK, Israel and China.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.33,1:22:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看 - 那上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look! - Look up there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.83,1:22:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,到目前为止 白宫尚未发表任何声明\N{\fnArial\fs30}So far, there has been no response from the White House.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.50,1:22:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,目击证人来自世界各地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eyewitness reports have been pouring in from affiliates across the globe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.67,1:22:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,当局无法分辨属于和平还是战争行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Authorities are not sure if it was an act of peace or an act of war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.31,1:22:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的天父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our dear Father…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.19,1:22:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,请引领我们走向光明\N{\fnArial\fs30}hold me in the light of God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.53,1:22:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,出事的应该是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It should have been me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.78,1:22:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他这一生还有很多大事\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was the one that was gonna do something with his life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.20,1:22:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,要靠他完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was always the one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.45,1:22:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不全然是他的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not how he felt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.00,1:22:50.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他觉得你也是能成就大事的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He felt you were the one that was gonna do something special with your life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.88,1:22:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能让影响这世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you were gonna make a difference in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.13,1:22:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至改变它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe even change it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.88,1:23:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道他的想法？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know what he felt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.14,1:23:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道所有人的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what everybody feels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.91,1:23:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,引领我们走向光明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold me in the light of God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.20,1:23:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,免我于危难\N{\fnArial\fs30}Protect me from danger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.45,1:23:28.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,以您的示谕拯救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save me by Your command.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.21,1:23:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,请聆听我的祷告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to my prayer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.17,1:23:35.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,保佑我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And keep me safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.25,1:24:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你限制了我的能力我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're blocking me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.71,1:24:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.88,1:24:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能阻挡你侵入他们的意识\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can shield their minds from your power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.34,1:24:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我千百年来获得的众多天赋之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's one of the many gifts I've acquired throughout the millennia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.97,1:24:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,但要洞悉他人的意识\N{\fnArial\fs30}But to see inside a mind…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.47,1:24:26.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,及控制它\N{\fnArial\fs30}to control it…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.93,1:24:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你的天赋\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's your gift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.06,1:24:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你领略到了 不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw it, didn't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.35,1:24:35.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,即将发生壮观景象\N{\fnArial\fs30}The glory of what's to come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.44,1:24:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要参与这场杀戮 毁灭世界吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to take part in all this killing and destruction?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.24,1:24:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这我早就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all I've ever known.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.66,1:24:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it isn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.70,1:24:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've just forgotten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.99,1:24:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 查尔斯 我都记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Charles, I remember.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.25,1:24:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的方式是行不通的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your way doesn't work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.16,1:24:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给他一个更好的选择 更好的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've shown him a better way.A better world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.59,1:25:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是在利用他的愤怒和痛苦 仅此而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you've just tapped into his rage and pain. That's all you've done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.26,1:25:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们相遇那一刻起我就告诉过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you from the moment I met you, there is more to you, Erik.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.72,1:25:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你身上还有很多美好的事物\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is good in you, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.51,1:25:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不论你在我身上看到了什么 查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever it is you think you saw in me, Charles…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.64,1:25:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已将它和我的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I buried it…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.48,1:25:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,一同埋葬了\N{\fnArial\fs30}with my family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.95,1:25:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？- 怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.41,1:25:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么变成这样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.95,1:25:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也会这样吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that going to happen to all of us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.87,1:25:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会 我忘了带药出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I just… left my meds in the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.17,1:25:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么事？我们在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened? Where are we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.46,1:25:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.00,1:25:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 魔形女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Mystique.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.26,1:25:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,史崔克少校\N{\fnArial\fs30}Major Stryker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.76,1:25:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是史崔克上校\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colonel Stryker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.84,1:25:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我是你 我不会离墙太近\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't get too close to the wall, if I were you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.14,1:25:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那会让你们有些不适…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It may create some discomfort.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.39,1:25:51.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是莫伊拉·玛塔格 CIA高级官员\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Moira MacTaggert. I'm a senior officer at the CIA.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.14,1:25:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你是谁 玛塔格探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know who you are, Agent MacTaggert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.43,1:25:56.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你无权把我关在这…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cannot keep me here, in this…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.31,1:25:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然有权\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, I can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.69,1:26:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,通灵事件销毁了所有的核弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}A psychic event just destroyed every nuke from here to Moscow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.78,1:26:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在案发地点找到了你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}That event emanated from exactly where we found you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.65,1:26:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那座世上最强大的心灵研究园地\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the home of the world's most powerful psychic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.28,1:26:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以现在请你诉我查尔斯·泽维尔人在何方？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you are going to tell me, where is Charles Xavier?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.11,1:26:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在该担心的不是查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not him you should be worried about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.54,1:26:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一个人有更强大力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's someone else. Someone more powerful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.29,1:26:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你放了我们 我们还能帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you let us out of here, we can help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.46,1:26:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真以为我会相信你说的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you really expect me to believe that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.59,1:26:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能伪装成任何人 可我知道你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can put on any face that you want, but I know who you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.43,1:26:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你的能耐\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.23,1:26:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 莫伊拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Moira.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.02,1:26:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说还有人比查尔斯更厉害？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you mean when you said someone more powerful than Charles?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.07,1:26:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,等他做完这个 我们就出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once they finish these, we'll go from there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.49,1:26:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么还没搞定？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's taking so long?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.08,1:26:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我进不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't get in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.37,1:26:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面好像也有磁场\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have a field around it, like the helicopter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.25,1:26:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,得想办法切断电源\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's gotta be a way to cut the power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.46,1:27:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charles…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.83,1:27:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要把我的话传送给世上所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}you will send a message…to every living mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.92,1:27:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要告诉他们 这地球将变成废墟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will tell them that this earth will be laid waste.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.84,1:27:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我 恩·沙巴·奴尔对类人的惩罚\N{\fnArial\fs30}That it is I, En Sabah Nur…who will wreak this upon them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.14,1:27:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.94,1:27:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,传递我的讯息\N{\fnArial\fs30}deliver my message.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.11,1:27:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算我愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if I wanted to…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.07,1:27:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有超脑我无法同时连接所有人的脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't reach that many people. I don't have Cerebro.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.12,1:27:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不需要机器… 来增强你的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't need a machine to amplify your powers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.04,1:27:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.14,1:27:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 我们可以靠这个出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, that could be our way out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.14,1:28:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识他？万磁王\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know him? Magneto?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.56,1:28:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾经\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.81,1:28:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我不确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not so sure anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.61,1:28:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是什么样的人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was he like?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.49,1:28:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是不是像人们说的那样 他是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was he like they say he was? Was he…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.16,1:28:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个坏蛋？\N{\fnArial\fs30}the bad guy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.53,1:28:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.74,1:28:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 是的 当年他…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, yeah. He was…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.83,1:28:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么这么关心他 是因为在电视上看到他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you care so much? You see his speech on TV or something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.00,1:28:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.55,1:28:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's my father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.22,1:28:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.72,1:28:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他和我妈 他们… - 行了 我懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Him and my mom, they did it. - No, I know…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.93,1:28:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.22,1:28:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 是啊 是的 在我出生前他弃我妈而去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. He left my mom before I was born.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.52,1:28:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我10年前见过他 但我没认出他来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I met him 10 years back but I didn't know it was him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.48,1:28:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我知道时候已经太迟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the time I figured it out, it was too late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.57,1:28:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后 这个星期我在电视上又看到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then, this week I saw him on TV again…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.78,1:28:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且 我去他家找过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I came to that house, looking for him…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.45,1:28:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 我到了那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}but by the time I got there…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.95,1:28:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,又迟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Late again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.83,1:29:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然我动作很快\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a guy who moves as fast as me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.75,1:29:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但好像总是迟到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always seem to be too late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.83,1:29:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们希望这次不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's hope not this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.88,1:29:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.88,1:29:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.09,1:29:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hear me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.22,1:29:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个世界上所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}inhabitants of this world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.26,1:29:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事？- 这是给你们的忠告\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is that? - This is a message.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.05,1:29:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像是教授\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's the Professor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.76,1:29:22.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,给每个人类和变种人的忠告\N{\fnArial\fs30}A message to every man, woman, and mutant in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.77,1:29:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们已经迷失了方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have lost your way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.52,1:29:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们已经迷失了方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have lost your way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.73,1:29:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 我已归位\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I have returned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.23,1:29:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 我已归位\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I have returned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.74,1:29:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,最终审判时刻已到\N{\fnArial\fs30}The day of reckoning is here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.70,1:29:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们所有的建设…\N{\fnArial\fs30}All your buildings…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.49,1:29:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们所有的琼楼玉宇…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…all of your towers and temples…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.04,1:29:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,都将倒塌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will fall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.96,1:29:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个新纪元即将出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the dawn of a new age will rise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.80,1:29:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们根本无力反抗…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…for there is nothing you can do…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.05,1:29:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 琴 - 阻止即将发生的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jean. - …to stop what is coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.01,1:30:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,琴 如果你能听到 仔细聆听我的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jean, if you can hear me, focus on my voice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.56,1:30:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,开罗 找到我们 琴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cairo. Find us, Jean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.10,1:30:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到我们 在开罗 找到我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find us. Cairo. Find us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.52,1:30:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,传递这个讯息只有一个目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This message is for one reason alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.61,1:30:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你们当中最强的人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}To tell the strongest among you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.98,1:30:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,拥有最强能力的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those with the greatest power…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.11,1:30:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个地球将属于你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}this earth will be yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.07,1:30:22.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些拥有最强能力的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those with the greatest power…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.54,1:30:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护那些没有能力的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}protect those without.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.42,1:30:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我给世界的讯息\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my message to the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.43,1:30:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,查尔斯没用超脑发讯息\N{\fnArial\fs30}How was Charles doing that without Cerebro?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.09,1:30:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 是谁在说话？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, what was that voice?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.10,1:30:44.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认得那声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that voice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.35,1:30:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是泽维尔 对不对 怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Xavier, isn't it? What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.10,1:30:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们不知道 - 我们不知道 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We don't know! - We don't know, bro!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.73,1:30:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是跟我说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just spoke to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.98,1:30:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他是对所有人说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he spoke to everyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.23,1:30:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我也能听到 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I could hear him, too. - No, no…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.82,1:30:55.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他刚给我发了一个隐藏的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}he just sent me a hidden message.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.65,1:30:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道只有我听得到\N{\fnArial\fs30}One he knew only I would hear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.03,1:30:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道他们在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know where they are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.82,1:31:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.24,1:31:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,有枪声 从哪来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have shots fired! Where's it coming from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.83,1:31:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,六号牢区发现入侵者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have intruders in Quad Six.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.46,1:31:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,派遣警备队抓人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send a security team. Take them out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.30,1:31:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,发电机室 这值得一试\N{\fnArial\fs30}The generator. It's worth a shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.30,1:31:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,库尔特？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kurt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.95,1:31:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里面有某种动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's some kind of animal in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.58,1:31:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's no animal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.75,1:31:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.63,1:31:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.05,1:32:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他部分记忆被消除了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That part of him as been taken away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.34,1:32:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.89,1:32:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说他们把他变成某种武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean they turned him into some kind of weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.64,1:32:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,C3组 请回答 找到目标没？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie Three, report. Did you find them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.78,1:32:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它关掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut it down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.77,1:32:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.45,1:33:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,X武器已逃逸 复诵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weapon X is loose!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.49,1:33:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,X武器已逃逸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I repeat, Weapon X is loose!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.33,1:33:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定那不是动物？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure he's not an animal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.71,1:33:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他在中央大厅 - 第5区发现目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's into the central halls. - Engaging target Sector Five.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.59,1:33:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们阻止不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.85,1:33:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.58,1:34:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们在干什么？- 这是怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are they doing? - What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.29,1:34:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快放我们出去 - 这里发生了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I just lost feed. - Hey! What's going on here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.47,1:34:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be right back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.85,1:34:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.78,1:34:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 留在原地别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Stay where you are!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.80,1:34:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,史考特 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scott, wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.43,1:34:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.77,1:35:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,琴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.64,1:35:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗根 罗根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Logan. Logan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.53,1:36:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对他做了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd you do to him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.45,1:36:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到他失去的一段记忆还给他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found a piece of his past and gave it back to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.33,1:36:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也只能帮他找到那些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just the few memories I could reach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.62,1:36:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想以后不会再见到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope that's the last we've seen of that guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.39,1:37:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,库尔特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kurt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.19,1:37:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.69,1:37:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.74,1:37:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开这个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay away from the…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.24,1:37:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.53,1:37:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这 门\N{\fnArial\fs30}The do…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.91,1:37:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开这门…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay away from the…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.24,1:37:21.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开这门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get away from the door!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.54,1:37:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,三 二 一\N{\fnArial\fs30}On three. One… two…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.93,1:37:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道教授在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know where the Professor is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.60,1:37:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们可能有办法离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we might have a way out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.10,1:37:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 你一直在忙 - 我们得到了一点帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, you've been busy. - We had a little help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.10,1:37:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.36,1:37:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.52,1:37:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sorry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.69,1:37:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这条路\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.29,1:38:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这本来是宇宙的中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was meant to be the center of the universe…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.96,1:38:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我被出卖之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}before I was betrayed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.87,1:38:08.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.63,1:38:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,它将会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}it will be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:30.71,1:39:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:32.07,1:39:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 汉克 你能驾驶它吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Hank, do you think you can fly this thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.80,1:39:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我会搞定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I can figure it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:39.01,1:39:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.30,1:39:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞行装\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flight suits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:46.68,1:39:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,去搞定你的战机吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got your warplane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:48.85,1:39:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备开战\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go to war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:57.49,1:39:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这份天赋…\N{\fnArial\fs30}A gift…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:59.40,1:40:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你先辈留给你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the past you left behind…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:02.53,1:40:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,而同样的你的未来就在眼前\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the future that lies ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:06.66,1:40:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,运用你的力量 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will reach down, my son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:10.33,1:40:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,深入到地心里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deep into the earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.63,1:40:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,把人类在地上建造的全都给我撕碎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rip everything they've built from the ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:16.05,1:40:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,彻底清理这个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wipe clean this world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:18.80,1:40:22.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将带领那些幸存者\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we will lead those that survive…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.51,1:40:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,创造更美好的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}into a better one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.72,1:40:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.43,1:40:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你的疯狂计划里我该扮演什么样的角色？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I to play a role in this madness?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:32.73,1:40:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可是重中之重\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have the most important role of all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:47.66,1:40:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你害怕吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were you scared?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:49.87,1:40:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,当年你在华盛顿特区害怕吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That day in D.C., were you scared?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:52.00,1:40:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:59.21,1:41:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我出第一次任务时很怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I was scared on my first mission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:02.26,1:41:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时和朋友坐在像现在这样的飞机上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was on a plane like this with my friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:04.72,1:41:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你的年纪差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}About your age.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:09.68,1:41:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们称自己为X战警\N{\fnArial\fs30}We called ourselves the X-Men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:13.39,1:41:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你哥哥当时也在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother was there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:15.44,1:41:16.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都称呼他「浩劫」\N{\fnArial\fs30}We used to call him Havok.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:17.36,1:41:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的能力很难控制 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a real handful…but{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:21.24,1:41:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,战斗中他很勇敢\N{\fnArial\fs30}when it came down to it, he was very brave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:26.16,1:41:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那跟你们一起的其他人呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to the rest of the kids who went with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.99,1:41:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,X战警\N{\fnArial\fs30}The X-Men?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:32.96,1:41:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有汉克和我还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hank and I are the only ones left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.87,1:41:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没能救到其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't save the rest of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:38.71,1:41:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过我不是英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you, I'm not a hero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:41.21,1:41:43.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我们而言你就是英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you're a hero to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.80,1:41:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那天在电视上看见你改变了我的一生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seeing you that day on changed my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:47.51,1:41:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mine, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:49.64,1:41:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mine, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:52.52,1:41:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是 虽然我还住在我妈的地下室 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still live in my mom's basement but, you know…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:56.23,1:41:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,生活中的其他事…\N{\fnArial\fs30}everything else is…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:59.65,1:42:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像还是老样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's pretty much the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:03.44,1:42:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是个彻底的失败者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a total loser.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:04.96,1:43:07.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在看到的是一个地磁现象\N{\fnArial\fs30}What we're seeing is a magnetic phenomenon…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:07.42,1:43:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,比我们在奥斯威辛看到的规模更大\N{\fnArial\fs30}on a much larger scale than what we saw at Auschwitz.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.30,1:43:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,地表层满是地磁元素 铁 镍 钴\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ground is full of magnetic elements. Iron, nickel, cobalt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:14.68,1:43:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,而海底表层也同样如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ocean's floor is lined with them, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:17.23,1:43:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,此现象已经开始了 来自地心深处\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's already begun at the lowest depths.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:20.06,1:43:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,陆地能阻挡一阵子 但撑不了太久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Land masses will slow it, but not for long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:23.36,1:43:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,最终城市 都市中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eventually, cities, urban centers…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:26.36,1:43:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,自铜器时代造就的一切均将毁灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}anything built since the Bronze Age will be wiped away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.24,1:43:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡人数将达数十亿\N{\fnArial\fs30}The death toll will be in the billions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:31.82,1:43:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是在说整个世界都将毁灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's talking about the whole goddamn world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:23.54,1:44:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只不过是另一个伪神\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just another false god.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.84,1:44:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论是谁追随了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And whoever's left to follow you when this all over…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.30,1:44:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们终将会再次背叛你\N{\fnArial\fs30}they will betray you again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:33.59,1:44:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你错了 查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wrong, Charles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.93,1:44:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我千百次轮回中 …\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the first time in a thousand lifetimes…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:39.68,1:44:41.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:41.69,1:44:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拥有无数天赋 但始终没找到我最需要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}For all my gifts, I have yet to possess the one I needed most.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:47.94,1:44:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:49.90,1:44:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,无所不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}everywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:54.87,1:44:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,成为…\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:56.83,1:44:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}everyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:13.88,1:45:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,第七大奇观 12点方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seventh wonder, twelve o'clock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:24.06,1:45:26.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,教授在金字塔的中间\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has the Professor in the center of the pyramid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:27.23,1:45:30.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要将他的意念移转给教授\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's going to transfer his consciousness into the Professor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:30.78,1:45:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他得逞了 那他就能控制这世上所有人的心智\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he does that, he'll have the power to control every mind in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:42.16,1:45:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又是怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:45.25,1:45:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是艾瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Erik.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:56.34,1:45:58.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们协助夜行者潜入金字塔内\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys help Nightcrawler get into the pyramid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.26,1:46:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,救出查尔斯 我去对付艾瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get Charles. I'll take care of Erik.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:02.98,1:46:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,要怎么通过那里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are we gonna get through that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:05.60,1:46:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以帮你过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can get you in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:07.44,1:46:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为了他而来 让我帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came here for him. Let me help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:10.36,1:46:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他人去救查尔斯 并带他离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rest of you, get Charles on this plane and get him out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:13.11,1:46:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们不会丢下你的 - 别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're not leaving without you! - Don't worry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:15.70,1:46:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会赶上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll catch up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:16.95,1:46:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐稳了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:48.65,1:46:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉克 你跟孩子们一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hank, you go with the kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:50.02,1:46:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 莫伊拉在飞机上等着 - 等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Moira will be waiting on the plane. - Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.65,1:46:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:53.82,1:46:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都还不能完全控制自己的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not all of us can fully control our powers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:56.65,1:46:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就别控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.32,1:47:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽情发挥\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to embrace them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:03.33,1:47:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:28.44,1:47:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧 和他们一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go. Join the others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:31.52,1:47:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护我 直到我完成移转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Protect me, until the transference is complete.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:59.88,1:48:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,前面入口安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's an entrance. It's clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:05.72,1:48:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,库尔特 快进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kurt! Get in there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:18.24,1:48:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,进金字塔 行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the pyramid! Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:20.32,1:48:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:57.82,1:48:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们分开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Split them up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:22.63,1:49:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好 教授\N{\fnArial\fs30}Professor…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:27.64,1:49:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,库尔特 你得快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kurt, you have to hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:28.97,1:49:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在找 这里像个迷宫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying. It's like a maze in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:41.49,1:49:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,库尔特 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kurt, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:08.01,1:50:09.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,磁场太强 我们没法进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}The magnetic field is too strong. I can't get us in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:12.85,1:50:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Erik!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:21.19,1:50:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔形女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mystique.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:26.53,1:50:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你觉得你已经失去了一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you think you've lost everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:30.24,1:50:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 你没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you haven't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:33.29,1:50:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:35.71,1:50:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have Charles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:43.55,1:50:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有你不知道的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have more family than you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:47.38,1:50:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以前没能保护家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never had the chance to save your family before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:51.22,1:50:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你现在有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you do now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:55.56,1:50:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来这里就是要告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I've come here to tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:03.44,1:51:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:13.91,1:51:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm your…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:19.92,1:51:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是为了我家人而来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here for my family, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:11.51,1:52:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚出去 滚出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out. Get out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:13.51,1:52:14.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:21.69,1:52:23.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Auf Wiedersehen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:34.74,1:52:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他支持不住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're losing him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:52.34,1:52:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be right back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:04.40,1:53:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,史考特 戴上眼镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scott, glasses on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:15.70,1:53:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:33.55,1:53:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 锁定 - 出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Locked on. - Here we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:52.90,1:53:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,灵蝶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Psylocke!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:10.42,1:54:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么鬼东西？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:18.30,1:54:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,库尔特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kurt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:19.76,1:54:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都抓紧夜行者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone, grab hold of Nightcrawler!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:21.26,1:54:22.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来没有带过这么多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never done it with this many people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:22.77,1:54:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,带我们离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get us out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:39.62,1:54:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,库尔特 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kurt, hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:42.37,1:54:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,库尔特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kurt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:09.40,1:55:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charles…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:16.32,1:55:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:17.82,1:55:20.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是筋疲力尽了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's his energy. He's drained.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:21.49,1:55:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:23.49,1:55:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:24.49,1:55:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,教授 教授 没事了 是我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Professor, it's okay. You're with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:27.91,1:55:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:38.01,1:55:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我决定回去为他们而战\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to fight for what I have left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:44.01,1:55:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:58.82,1:56:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到了许多连你自己都不知道的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's so much more to you than you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:01.49,1:56:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不只是痛苦和愤怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not just pain and anger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:04.62,1:56:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有许多美好的回忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's good, too. I felt it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:07.00,1:56:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你抛下的不仅仅是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not just me you're walking away from.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:09.04,1:56:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有机会成就比自己更伟大的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, you have the chance to be a part of something much bigger than yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:13.38,1:56:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要你 艾瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it needs you, Erik.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:45.03,1:56:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,一群废物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Useless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:52.50,1:56:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:56.09,1:56:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你能听到我的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you can hear me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:59.09,1:57:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们仍然联系着彼此\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're still connected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:05.89,1:57:06.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charles!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:08.01,1:57:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show yourself!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:11.06,1:57:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charles!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:13.39,1:57:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,快给我出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show yourself!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:45.22,1:57:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,傻小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Foolish child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:55.77,1:57:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:13.83,1:58:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,终结他\N{\fnArial\fs30}End him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:41.52,1:58:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞雯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:50.83,1:58:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,伟大的英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}The great hero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:57.29,1:58:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我去救他们 - 我和你一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm going out there. - I'm going with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:59.67,1:59:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:02.09,1:59:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他要的是我 - 查尔斯 你不能自投罗网\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's me he wants. - Charles, you can't give yourself up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:05.17,1:59:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他找到你 我们就都完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he has you, he has us all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:07.22,1:59:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至整个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:09.01,1:59:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和其他人一样不堪一击\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are feeble. Just like the others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:13.18,1:59:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charles!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:14.35,1:59:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:15.35,1:59:16.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,拯救这群软脚虾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rescue your weaklings!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:18.35,1:59:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,用你的命来换他们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give your life for theirs!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:22.23,1:59:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:31.37,1:59:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说的对\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:33.53,1:59:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和他之间有某种联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is still some part of me connected to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:37.00,1:59:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charles!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:37.96,1:59:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也可以进入他的脑子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can get inside his head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:39.71,1:59:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要坐视不理吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you do nothing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:43.04,1:59:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你让我进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for letting me in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:02.94,2:00:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是想要我的能力吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want what I have?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:04.65,2:00:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想体会我的感受吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to feel what I feel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:18.62,2:00:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到我的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to my world!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:22.63,2:00:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你在我的地盘里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in my house now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:34.05,2:00:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你地盘不够大\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll need a bigger house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:55.47,2:01:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你背叛了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You betray me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:57.22,2:01:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:59.14,2:02:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我背叛了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I betrayed them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:28.92,2:02:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们跳下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's jump.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:30.17,2:02:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:36.43,2:02:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,掩护我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cover me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:39.89,2:02:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:46.56,2:02:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:09.04,2:03:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你弱爆了 查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}They lack strength, Charles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:17.80,2:03:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,琴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:24.77,2:03:26.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:38.45,2:03:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮帮…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:42.24,2:03:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:48.46,2:03:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,待在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:59.13,2:04:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们制不住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can't stop him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:01.43,2:04:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,琴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:05.01,2:04:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:30.29,2:04:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hank!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:32.67,2:04:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hank!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:40.93,2:04:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,到此结束 查尔斯 你完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's over, Charles. You're finished.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:44.05,2:04:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're mine now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:48.06,2:04:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你永远不会赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will never win.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:51.19,2:04:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么会这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:53.27,2:04:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你只有孤单一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you are alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:57.27,2:05:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I am not!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:12.67,2:05:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,让…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:14.29,2:05:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:16.29,2:05:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,释放你的力量 琴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unleash your power, Jean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:19.55,2:05:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}No fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:08.97,2:06:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,释放你的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unleash your power!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:11.64,2:06:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧 琴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let go, Jean!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:13.81,2:06:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,琴 去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jean, let go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:51.60,2:06:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想逃\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's getting away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:10.74,2:07:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果揭晓\N{\fnArial\fs30}All is revealed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:16.18,2:08:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,查尔斯 查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charles! Charles!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:19.44,2:08:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们已经失去他了 - 查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We've lost him! - Charles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:20.60,2:08:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他走了 - 不 查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's gone. - No, Charles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:22.44,2:08:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,查尔斯…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charles…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:23.94,2:08:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he's not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:26.53,2:08:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还可以感应到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can still feel him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:51.97,2:08:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 琴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Jean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:55.72,2:08:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,查尔斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charles?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:57.72,2:08:59.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,查尔斯 你知道你在哪里吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charles, do you know where you are?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:02.81,2:09:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在古巴的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on a beach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:10.57,2:09:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,海滩上\N{\fnArial\fs30}In Cuba.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:13.99,2:09:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你\N{\fnArial\fs30}With you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:15.82,2:09:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么海滩？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What beach?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:24.88,2:09:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,查尔斯·泽维尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charles Xavier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:52.78,2:09:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:54.86,2:09:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不应该让你失去那些记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should never have taken those from you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:00.62,2:10:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:06.75,2:10:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我错过了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did I miss?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:10.92,2:10:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来只有靠上帝的恩典\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems only by the grace of God…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:13.55,2:10:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这恶意的毁坏…\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the ominous destruction…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:14.93,2:10:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,从世界的一端到另一端 也都停止了\N{\fnArial\fs30}seen from one end of the globe to the other, has stopped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:17.93,2:10:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,在今天的汇报中 中情局特派员莫伊拉·玛塔格\N{\fnArial\fs30}At a debriefing today, CIA Special Agent Moira MacTaggert…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:20.47,2:10:22.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,向调查委员会报告…\N{\fnArial\fs30}revealed to an investigative committee…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:22.81,2:10:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,颇为震惊的消息是逃犯艾瑞克·兰谢尔 …\N{\fnArial\fs30}The committee was further stunned to learn that fugitive Erik Lehnsherr…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:25.94,2:10:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,协助击败了这个强大而难缠的敌人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}aided in defeating this powerful and unknown…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:28.31,2:10:30.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我们的祈祷应验了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think our prayers were answered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:31.40,2:10:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 总统先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Mr. President.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:32.99,2:10:34.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,变种人的潜在破坏力…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The potential destructive power of mutants…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:34.65,2:10:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,势必掀起另一波争论\N{\fnArial\fs30}…is sure to fuel new controversy and debate…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:36.91,2:10:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,而此时变种人逐渐在世界各地被接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}at a time when mutants were becoming accepted around the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:07.77,2:11:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔形女告诉我 他是你的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mystique told me he is your father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:11.32,2:11:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会告诉他吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you gonna tell him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:14.61,2:11:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I might…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:16.53,2:11:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,某天吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}one day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:19.28,2:11:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想目前 我会在这里待一段时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think for now, I'm just gonna stick around here for a while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:27.96,2:11:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:40.22,2:11:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这世界又开始重建武装\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world's already begun rebuilding its arsenals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:43.85,2:11:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是人的天性 查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's human nature, Charles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:47.85,2:11:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是抱着希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still have hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:50.48,2:11:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:52.90,2:11:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,「希望」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Hope."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:54.82,2:11:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没错看瑞雯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was right about Raven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:57.40,2:11:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至我也没看错你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was even right about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:02.57,2:12:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那世上其他人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the rest of the world?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:05.99,2:12:08.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可曾在半夜里惊醒？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't it ever wake you up in the middle of the night?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:10.87,2:12:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉有那么一天他们会来找你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The feeling that one day they'll come for you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:14.09,2:12:16.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你的孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:17.59,2:12:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}It does, indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:19.51,2:12:22.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你醒来以后想些什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you do when you wake up to that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:23.55,2:12:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为那些到学校找我麻烦的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel a great swell of pity for the poor soul…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:26.18,2:12:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怜虫感到悲哀\N{\fnArial\fs30}that comes to my school looking for trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:34.52,2:12:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的没办法说服你留下来吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're sure I can't convince you to stay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:38.40,2:12:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是心灵大师 查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're psychic, Charles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:40.70,2:12:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以说服我做任何事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can convince me to do anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:45.37,2:12:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 老朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye, old friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:47.95,2:12:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运 教授\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck, Professor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:54.85,2:12:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,忘了你认为你知道的所有事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget everything you think you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:58.38,2:13:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论你在学校学到什么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever lessons you learned in school…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:02.13,2:13:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是你的父母怎么教你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}whatever your parents taught you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:05.55,2:13:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些都不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of that matters!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:09.89,2:13:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不再是小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not kids anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:12.31,2:13:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们也不是学生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not students.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:18.07,2:13:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是X战警\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're X-Men.{\r}
